    engine2d_interpreter_span_kernel_marshalling_perf_gap_2026-08-14, 902, "2026-11-13: On release/1.0.0 35144b7f5e9, Linux aarch64 seed af717f53d6bce3e5 the tracked rig test/perf/graphics_2d/bench_span_kernels.spl died with semantic: unknown extern function: rt_println (rc=1); rig now uses print and runs (rc=0). One run, arch=aarch64 native_rows=true width=640 iters=400: fill 298 ms, copy 10 ms, blend 18 ms, blit 6 ms (about 1164 / 39 / 70 / 23 ns per px including per-call overhead; single ms-resolution sample, not comparable with the x86_64 table). Bulk write_span path confirmed in source; fill remains the outlier tracked by interp_indexed_array_store_regression_2026-11-11."

